WEBVTT

00:34:57.760 --> 00:35:01.724
China recognized the importance of AI
about two years ago,

00:35:01.748 --> 00:35:04.911
and started coming out
with various policies.

00:35:05.220 --> 00:35:10.172
The most important one was probably
the state council plan,

00:35:10.196 --> 00:35:15.678
and that plan basically set the tone
of how important AI is.

00:35:15.988 --> 00:35:19.495
But all the local governments
started to execute.

00:35:19.519 --> 00:35:23.971
So some local governments
would reward AI companies,

00:35:23.995 --> 00:35:28.917
others would help create VC funds
to invest in AI companies.

00:35:28.941 --> 00:35:30.425
But most importantly,